<div class="header">
<h1 style="color:#fff;border:none;margin:0">DANKCONNECT GH 🇬🇭</h1>
<p style="margin:5px 0 0">Privacy Policy & Terms of Service</p>
<p style="font-size:12px;margin:5px 0 0">Empowered by DANK-EMPIRE</p>
</div>

<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> October 22, 2026<br>
<strong>Last Updated:</strong> October 22, 2026<br>
<strong>Controller:</strong> DANK-EMPIRE / DANKCONNECT GH<br>
<strong>Contact:</strong> <a href="mailto:dankconnect15@gmail.com">dankconnect15@gmail.com</a><br>
<strong>Location:</strong> Accra, Ghana</p>

<h2>1. Introduction</h2>
<p>DANKCONNECT GH ("we", "us", "our") is a social communication platform operated by DANK-EMPIRE in Ghana. This policy complies with the <strong>Data Protection Act, 2012 (Act 843)</strong> of Ghana and the <strong>Cybersecurity Act, 2020 (Act 1038)</strong>. By using our App, you agree to this policy.</p>

<h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
<div class="card">
<ul>
<li><strong>Account Data:</strong> Username, display name, profile photo (if you upload)</li>
<li><strong>Contact Data:</strong> Phone number or email if you provide for login</li>
<li><strong>Content Data:</strong> Messages, posts, images you share in the app</li>
<li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> Device type, browser, IP address, app version for security</li>
<li><strong>No Financial Data:</strong> We do not collect MoMo PIN, bank cards or passwords</li>
</ul>
</div>

<h2>3. How We Use Your Data</h2>
<ul>
<li>To provide and improve chat and social features</li>
<li>To keep the platform safe, prevent fraud, spam and abuse</li>
<li>To respond to support and legal requests</li>
<li>We will NEVER sell your data to third parties</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Legal Basis (Act 843)</h2>
<p>We process your data based on your consent when you create an account and check "I agree". You can withdraw consent by deleting your account anytime.</p>

<h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
<p>We do NOT share your personal data except:</p>
<ul>
<li>When required by Ghana Police, Cyber Security Authority, or court order</li>
<li>With hosting providers (e.g., GitHub, Firebase) only to store the app securely</li>
<li>When you explicitly share content with other users</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Data Security & Retention</h2>
<p>We use reasonable security measures to protect your data. Messages are stored securely. We retain your account data until you delete your account. You can request deletion anytime via Contact email. We will delete within 30 days.</p>

<h2>7. Your Rights Under Act 843</h2>
<div class="card">
You have the right to:
<br>✅ Access your data
<br>✅ Correct inaccurate data
<br>✅ Delete your account and data (Right to be Forgotten)
<br>✅ Object to processing
<br>✅ Report misuse to Data Protection Commission, Ghana - <a href="https://www.dataprotection.org.gh" target="_blank">dataprotection.org.gh</a>
<br><br>To exercise, email us at <a href="mailto:dankconnect15@gmail.com">dankconnect15@gmail.com</a>
</div>

<h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>You must be <strong>13 years or older</strong> to use DANKCONNECT GH. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13. If we discover such data, we will delete it immediately.</p>

<h2>9. Content Rules & Terms of Use</h2>
<p>By using DANKCONNECT GH you agree NOT to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Post pornographic, nude, or sexual content involving children - ZERO TOLERANCE, instant ban + report to CSA</li>
<li>Commit fraud, Sakawa, MoMo scams, impersonation</li>
<li>Post hate speech, threats, or defamation against any person or tribe</li>
<li>Share someone's private photos, number or location without consent</li>
<li>Spam or distribute viruses</li>
</ul>
<p>We have the right to remove content and ban accounts that violate these rules. We provide Report, Block, and Delete functions inside the app.</p>

<h2>10. Reporting Abuse</h2>
<div class="card">
If you see abuse: Use in-app Report button or email <a href="mailto:dankconnect15@gmail.com">dankconnect15@gmail.com</a> with username and screenshot. We review within 24-48 hours.
<br><br>
For serious crimes, we will cooperate with Ghana Police Cybercrime Unit and Cyber Security Authority as required by Act 1038.
</div>

<h2>11. Hosting & International</h2>
<p>Our app is currently hosted on GitHub Pages / Firebase. Your data may be stored securely outside Ghana but remains protected under Act 843.</p>

<h2>12. Changes to Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this policy. We will post new date at top. Continued use means acceptance.</p>

<h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
<p>For privacy questions, account deletion, or complaints:<br>
<strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:dankconnect15@gmail.com">dankconnect15@gmail.com</a><br>
<strong>Project:</strong> DANKCONNECT GH - Empowered by DANK-EMPIRE<br>
<strong>Address:</strong> Accra, Greater Accra, Ghana</p>

